Title: "Version"
Id: "58df3f5d-ad48-492d-a2b5-31ff3b5a6e24"

Text: "`version:` is a nested metadata item for version text.

```mlg-fragment
Metadata:
. version: \"1\"
```

It is parsed as open text. It does not replace the required top-level `Id:` identity section."
Id: "703b62fb-e19e-4c98-bbc1-d5e00b81fcd4"
